== Exp Gain ==

=== Halfling Cleric ===

I created a new cleric and ran him back and forth doing this quest for 2.5 hours and got to level 5 and got 19 potions of wisdom. I had enough money vendoring the non-potion of wisdom rewards to buy all the level 1 & 5 spells and two backpacks. 
<br>

A level 2 Halfing Druid gets 1 yellow for every 3 run throughs (both turn ins).

